[slope] This is the rear end of the open display-component channel at S47.24. It bounds the hardware insertion clearance. In the tip's -95 degree print pose, the joint end faces the bed, the crown is raised and this channel-end face points upward. Preserve the opening and remove any adjacent support through the display opening or neck joint before loading hardware; physical removal and contact finish remain print observations.
